CREATE TABLE "CartItem" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"userId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "User"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,"variantId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "ProductVariant"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE,"quantity" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK ("quantity" BETWEEN 1 AND 20),"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL, UNIQUE("userId","variantId"));
CREATE INDEX "CartItem_variantId_idx" ON "CartItem"("variantId");
CREATE TABLE "WishlistItem" ("userId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "User"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,"productId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Product"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,PRIMARY KEY("userId","productId"));
CREATE INDEX "WishlistItem_productId_idx" ON "WishlistItem"("productId");
